  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Acute Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northern provinces of Mozambique (Nampula, Cabo Delgado, Zambezia) were hit by 3 consecutive cyclones of late, namely Chido (15Dec), Dikeledi (13Jan) and Jude (13Mrh),  collectively affecting 1.4million persons.
FH and ASAC provide both FSL and WASH to address urgent needs of 4,600 HHs (23,000 people) within host communities and IDP centres such as schools in Meconta and Mogincual districts.</narrative>
  </description>
